+        // every scan/batch -- that would recreate the worker repeatedly
+        // during normal usage (perf regression). Instead this is called
+        // only at session-end (sign-out) and as a best-effort safety net
+        // on page unload (see the pagehide listener near app bootstrap).
+        // Safe to call even if local OCR was never used (no provider /
+        // no worker created yet) or already terminated -- terminate()
+        // itself no-ops in both cases, and any failure is swallowed so
